{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-template-js","path":"/Web/JS/callback_function/","result":{"data":{"cur":{"id":"ed4c02fe-0093-5478-b0d2-c94ecb7b66c9","html":"<h1 id=\"callback-function\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#callback-function\" aria-label=\"callback function permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Callback Function</h1>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"콜백-함수\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%BD%9C%EB%B0%B1-%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98\" aria-label=\"콜백 함수 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>콜백 함수</h2>\n<p><strong>콜백함수: 파라미터로 함수를 전달하는 함수</strong></p>\n<p>→ 파라미터로 함수를 전달 받아 함수의 내부에서 실행하는 함수이다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\">button<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">addEventListener</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'click'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Button clicked!'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br>\n콜백함수를 사용하는 대표적인 이유는, <strong>동기와 비동기를 함께 썼을 때 순서를 보장</strong>할 수 있기 때문이다. 콜백을 중첩해서 원하는 순서대로 실행하도록 코드를 짤 수도 있다. 콜백이 대표적으로 쓰이는 곳은 <strong>데이터 통신</strong>이다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">getPost</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n  postNum<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">postId</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Post'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> postId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">getComments</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n      postId<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">result</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Comments:'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">message</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">message</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"사용-원칙\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9-%EC%9B%90%EC%B9%99\" aria-label=\"사용 원칙 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>사용 원칙</h2>\n<h3 id=\"익명-함수-사용\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9D%B5%EB%AA%85-%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9\" aria-label=\"익명 함수 사용 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>익명 함수 사용</h3>\n<p>함수의 이름이 없는 익명 함수를 사용한다. 함수의 내부에서 실행되기 때문에 이름을 붙이지 않아도 된다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> number <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\nnumber<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">forEach</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">x</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>x <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"함수-이름-전달\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98-%EC%9D%B4%EB%A6%84-%EC%A0%84%EB%8B%AC\" aria-label=\"함수 이름 전달 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>함수 이름 전달</h3>\n<p>자바스크립트는 함수 자체를 객체로서 전달이 가능한 특징이 있기에, 정의해둔 함수를 ()를 붙이지 않고 <strong>함수 이름만 호출 함수의 인자로 전달</strong>하는 방식으로 사용한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">greet</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Hello, '</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">sayHello</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">callback</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'SeoHyeon'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">callback</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 콜백 함수 호출</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token function\">sayHello</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>greet<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// sayHello(greet()); X</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// sayHello(greet); O</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"콜백-지옥\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%BD%9C%EB%B0%B1-%EC%A7%80%EC%98%A5\" aria-label=\"콜백 지옥 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>콜백 지옥</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 55.00000000000001%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"콜백지옥 장풍\"\n        title=\"콜백지옥 장풍\"\n        src=\"/static/3db82790ec7cf2b19f12c2dda84b6070/37523/callback_hell.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/3db82790ec7cf2b19f12c2dda84b6070/e9ff0/callback_hell.png 180w,\n/static/3db82790ec7cf2b19f12c2dda84b6070/f21e7/callback_hell.png 360w,\n/static/3db82790ec7cf2b19f12c2dda84b6070/37523/callback_hell.png 720w,\n/static/3db82790ec7cf2b19f12c2dda84b6070/302a4/callback_hell.png 1080w,\n/static/3db82790ec7cf2b19f12c2dda84b6070/9685e/callback_hell.png 1336w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<p><strong>콜백지옥: 콜백 함수가 중첩되어 가독성이 떨어지는 형태</strong></p>\n<p>비동기 호출이 자주 일어나는 경우 콜백 지옥이 발생하기 쉽다. 콜백지옥이 있다면 <strong>가독성이 좋지 않고 유지보수 및 수정이 어려워진다</strong>. 이를 해결하기 위한 방법으로 <strong>promise</strong>와 <strong>async&#x26;await</strong>이 있다.</p>\n<p><br><br><br></p>","excerpt":"Callback Function  콜백 함수 콜백함수: 파라미터로 함수를 전달하는 함수 → 파라미터로 함수를 전달 받아 함수의 내부에서 실행하는 함수이다. \n콜백함수를 사용하는 대표적인 이유는, 동기와 비동기를 함께 썼을 때 순서를 보장할 수 있기 때문이다. 콜백을 중첩해서 원하는 순서대로 실행하도록 코드를 짤 수도 있다. 콜백이 대표적으로 쓰이는 곳은 데이터 통신이다.  사용 원칙 익명 함수 사용 함수의 이름이 없는 익명 함수를 사용한다. 함수의 내부에서 실행되기 때문에 이름을 붙이지 않아도 된다.  함수 이름 전달 자바스크립트는 함수 자체를 객체로서 전달이 가능한 특징이 있기에, 정의해둔 함수를 ()를 붙이지 않고 함수 이름만 호출 함수의 인자로 전달하는 방식으로 사용한다.  콜백 지옥  콜백지옥: 콜백 함수가 중첩되어 가독성이 떨어지는 형태 비동기 호출이 자주 일어나는 경우 콜백 지옥이 발생하기 쉽다. 콜백지옥이 있다면 가독성이 좋지 않고 유지보수 및 수정이 어려워진다. 이를…","frontmatter":{"date":"August 03, 2023","title":"[Web] JS - Callback Function","categories":"Web","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/Web/JS/callback_function/"}},"next":{"id":"2cd023cf-6470-5f97-83b1-8341078f6472","html":"<h1 id=\"고정-소수점--부동-소수점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B3%A0%EC%A0%95-%EC%86%8C%EC%88%98%EC%A0%90--%EB%B6%80%EB%8F%99-%EC%86%8C%EC%88%98%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"고정 소수점  부동 소수점 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>고정 소수점 &#x26; 부동 소수점</h1>\n<p>컴퓨터에서 실수를 표현하는 방법 → 고정 소수점 / 부동 소수점</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 308px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 62.77777777777778%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"소수점 방식\"\n        title=\"소수점 방식\"\n        src=\"/static/78e64ea489b790829005ff076ae084a4/2ece4/points.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/78e64ea489b790829005ff076ae084a4/e9ff0/points.png 180w,\n/static/78e64ea489b790829005ff076ae084a4/2ece4/points.png 308w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 308px) 100vw, 308px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span><br>\n<br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"고정-소수점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B3%A0%EC%A0%95-%EC%86%8C%EC%88%98%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"고정 소수점 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>고정 소수점</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 8.333333333333332%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"고정 소수점\"\n        title=\"고정 소수점\"\n        src=\"/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/37523/fixed_point.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/e9ff0/fixed_point.png 180w,\n/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/f21e7/fixed_point.png 360w,\n/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/37523/fixed_point.png 720w,\n/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/302a4/fixed_point.png 1080w,\n/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/07a9c/fixed_point.png 1440w,\n/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/fbd44/fixed_point.png 2215w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>소수부의 자릿수를 미리 정해 고정된 자릿수의 소수를 표현</li>\n<li><strong>부호비트(1비트)</strong> - 실수가 음수면 부호비트에 1, 양수면 0 넣음</li>\n<li><strong>정수부(15비트)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>소수부(16비트)</strong></li>\n<li>정수부와 소수부의 경계를 소수점의 위치로 생각하고 2진수로 변환된 수 넣음</li>\n<li>정수부와 소수부의 자릿수가 크지 않으므로 표현할 수 있는 범위가 적음</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"부동-소수점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%B6%80%EB%8F%99-%EC%86%8C%EC%88%98%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"부동 소수점 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>부동 소수점</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 8.333333333333332%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"부동 소수점\"\n        title=\"부동 소수점\"\n        src=\"/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/37523/floating_point.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/e9ff0/floating_point.png 180w,\n/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/f21e7/floating_point.png 360w,\n/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/37523/floating_point.png 720w,\n/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/302a4/floating_point.png 1080w,\n/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/07a9c/floating_point.png 1440w,\n/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/fbd44/floating_point.png 2215w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>가수부와 지수부로 나누어 표현</li>\n<li><strong>부호비트(1비트)</strong> - 실수가 음수면 부호비트에 1, 양수면 0 넣음</li>\n<li>지수<strong>부(8비트)</strong> - 정규화 과정에서 얻어낸 지수에 bias를 더한 값</li>\n<li>가수<strong>부(23비트)</strong> - 소수 부분의 값</li>\n<li>매우 큰 실수까지 표현 가능</li>\n<li>대부분의 시스템에서 사용 중인 방식</li>\n<li>오차 발생 가능성</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://gguguk.github.io/posts/fixed_point_and_floating_point/\">https://gguguk.github.io/posts/fixed_point_and_floating_point/</a></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"August 01, 2023","title":"[CS] 컴퓨터구조 - 고정 소수점 & 부동 소수점","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/fixed_point_and_floating_point/"}},"prev":{"id":"424b98f2-3dc0-5c75-b9b4-977e39112111","html":"<h1 id=\"arm-processor\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#arm-processor\" aria-label=\"arm processor permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>ARM Processor</h1>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 533px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 85%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"ARM Processor\"\n        title=\"ARM Processor\"\n        src=\"/static/aa847fabe2586489da8007826a169866/a1aa0/ARM_processor.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/aa847fabe2586489da8007826a169866/e9ff0/ARM_processor.png 180w,\n/static/aa847fabe2586489da8007826a169866/f21e7/ARM_processor.png 360w,\n/static/aa847fabe2586489da8007826a169866/a1aa0/ARM_processor.png 533w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 533px) 100vw, 533px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>ARM</strong> = Advanced RISC Machine<br>\n<strong>Processor</strong> = 명령어를 처리하고 반응하기 위한 논리회로</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>ARM 프로세서는 다양한 휴대기기, 임베디드 기기에서 가장 많이 사용되는 32bit 프로세서이다. ARM는 <em>RISC 아키텍처</em>를 사용한다.  </p>\n<br>\n<h3 id=\"장점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9E%A5%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"장점 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>장점</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>전력 소모량 적음 ⭐️</li>\n<li>확장성 → 마이크로 컨트롤러 ~ 다중 코어 프로세서 다양한 칩으로 사용 가능</li>\n<li>스마트폰, 태블릿, 노트북, 웨어러블 기기, 임베디드 등 광범위한 사용</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"risc\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#risc\" aria-label=\"risc permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>RISC</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 495px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 77.77777777777777%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"RISC vs CISC\"\n        title=\"RISC vs CISC\"\n        src=\"/static/95b2990f91a7d2b1bee1ff8e9e8e4c40/a4d88/RISC_and_CISC.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/95b2990f91a7d2b1bee1ff8e9e8e4c40/e9ff0/RISC_and_CISC.png 180w,\n/static/95b2990f91a7d2b1bee1ff8e9e8e4c40/f21e7/RISC_and_CISC.png 360w,\n/static/95b2990f91a7d2b1bee1ff8e9e8e4c40/a4d88/RISC_and_CISC.png 495w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 495px) 100vw, 495px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>RISC</strong> = Reduced Instruction Set Computer</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>→ 적은 수의 명령어를 수행하도록 설계된 프로세서</p>\n<ul>\n<li>간단하고 고정된 길이의 명령어 세트 → 빠름</li>\n<li>레지스터 활용 → 메모리 접근 최소화 및 성능 향상</li>\n<li>파이프라이닝을 사용하여 병렬적으로 단계를 겹쳐서 처리 → 처리량 향상</li>\n<li>단일 사이클 실행 → 효율성 향상</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://code-lab1.tistory.com/174\">https://code-lab1.tistory.com/174</a></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"August 08, 2023","title":"[CS] 컴퓨터구조 - ARM Processor","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/ARM_processor/"}},"site":{"siteMetadata":{"siteUrl":"https://www.jsh99.com","comments":{"utterances":{"repo":"JSH99/JSH99.github.io"}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/Web/JS/callback_function/","nextSlug":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/fixed_point_and_floating_point/","prevSlug":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/ARM_processor/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1073350324","2938748437"]}